WEBVTT

00:22.200 --> 00:25.040
Sorry, I didn't know
that a blind date was arranged for me.

00:25.120 --> 00:27.320
I thought I was going
on a boat ride with Grandma.

00:27.400 --> 00:28.320
It's okay.

00:28.880 --> 00:31.760
You know all about me, right?

00:31.840 --> 00:32.840
You are a nurse.

00:33.320 --> 00:34.600
Your parents are pretty nice.

00:34.680 --> 00:37.200
You are three years older than me.

00:37.280 --> 00:38.240
Yes.

00:38.320 --> 00:40.320
I graduated from a formal nursing school.

00:40.400 --> 00:42.680
I wanted to work in the city
after graduation.

00:42.760 --> 00:45.920
The requirements of the hospitals
in the city are too high, so I came back.

00:47.880 --> 00:49.840
Our town is not too shabby.

00:49.920 --> 00:51.520
It depends on how you see it.

00:51.600 --> 00:53.920
My best friend
has connections through her family

00:54.000 --> 00:54.960
and stayed in the city.

00:55.040 --> 00:58.120
The bonuses and benefits of city hospitals
can't be found in this town.

00:58.200 --> 00:59.880
They even have an attached school.

00:59.960 --> 01:02.640
In the future, she won't have to worry
about her children's education.

01:03.600 --> 01:06.120
Actually, my friend and I

01:06.200 --> 01:07.560
have similar academic achievements.

01:07.640 --> 01:09.240
I even have more internship experience.

01:12.400 --> 01:14.120
This town will get better and better.

01:14.200 --> 01:15.880
That's all I can hope for.

01:15.960 --> 01:16.920
I'm mainly worried

01:17.000 --> 01:18.480
about the education and environment.

01:18.560 --> 01:20.560
My children might be at a disadvantage.

01:25.560 --> 01:26.440
Do you want a drink?

01:26.960 --> 01:28.480
I don't drink soft drinks.

01:32.520 --> 01:34.080
In fact, you should drink less.

01:45.280 --> 01:47.440
The economy in our town
is actually really good.

01:47.520 --> 01:48.800
But I still hope

01:48.880 --> 01:50.920
to return to the city in a few years.

01:51.000 --> 01:53.080
The spiritual life in the city is rich.

01:53.160 --> 01:54.800
On weekends, you can take the children

01:54.880 --> 01:56.240
to the library,

01:56.320 --> 01:58.080
the opera house, or the museum.

01:58.960 --> 02:00.480
You can even drive

02:00.560 --> 02:02.680
to go camping in the fields
and gaze at the stars.

02:03.800 --> 02:05.360
Only in that environment

02:05.440 --> 02:07.360
can people feel happiness.

02:07.960 --> 02:08.800
Don't you think so?

02:14.560 --> 02:16.840
Madam Wu said
your registered residence is in the city.

02:16.920 --> 02:18.040
Yes.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.440
What about your current job?

02:19.520 --> 02:21.160
Do you plan to keep doing it?

02:25.120 --> 02:26.360
What do you think of it?

02:26.440 --> 02:29.400
Honestly, my family and I feel

02:29.480 --> 02:30.760
that it shouldn't be long-term.

02:32.040 --> 02:33.440
Since we are on a blind date,

02:33.520 --> 02:35.160
marriage should be the end goal.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.440
I'm a down-to-earth person.

02:36.520 --> 02:37.920
I know a little bit

02:38.000 --> 02:39.280
about your past.

02:39.360 --> 02:40.400
Which aspect of it?

02:40.480 --> 02:41.560
You loved to fight.

02:41.640 --> 02:42.720
Divorced parents.

02:42.800 --> 02:45.480
Also, I heard that your grandma

02:45.560 --> 02:46.920
has a bad temper.

02:47.000 --> 02:49.080
You're right.
Your worries are well-founded.

02:49.920 --> 02:52.640
I'm mostly okay with it though.

02:53.720 --> 02:55.040
But what do you think about me?

02:58.040 --> 02:58.920
Great.

03:00.880 --> 03:02.720
I think you are great too.

03:02.800 --> 03:05.080
I have no problem
with your appearance and height.

03:05.680 --> 03:08.280
Moreover, the prodigal son coming home
is more valuable than gold.

03:08.360 --> 03:10.320
As long as you are 100% committed to me

03:10.400 --> 03:11.520
in the future.

03:11.600 --> 03:13.600
I will definitely treat you well.

03:20.440 --> 03:21.640
Chen Maidong.

03:24.400 --> 03:27.600
Why do you seem a little distracted?

03:31.600 --> 03:32.600
Sorry.

03:33.400 --> 03:35.920
Well, I think we can disembark ahead.

03:36.000 --> 03:37.000
Let's go there.

05:01.920 --> 05:06.560
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

05:19.840 --> 05:23.560
I really like a girl
who likes to smile like you.

05:23.640 --> 05:25.120
It's just pleasant to see you.

05:25.200 --> 05:27.160
By the way, what did you say

05:27.240 --> 05:29.160
your name is?

05:29.240 --> 05:31.200
Ma'am, my name is Zhuang Jie.

05:31.280 --> 05:32.240
My mom is Liao Tao.

05:32.320 --> 05:33.320
She runs Liaogen Braised Chicken.

05:34.480 --> 05:36.680
I love your chicken.

05:36.760 --> 05:38.640
Hurry, add me on WeChat.

05:38.720 --> 05:40.560
My name is Gu Beibei.

05:42.520 --> 05:44.200
Your name is so nice.

05:44.280 --> 05:45.680
Gu Beibei.

05:48.360 --> 05:50.600
How did you meet Maidong?

05:50.680 --> 05:52.280
We were high school classmates.

05:54.120 --> 05:55.480
Why haven't I heard?

05:56.760 --> 05:58.040
When I was in my senior year,

05:58.120 --> 05:59.840
I went to stay
with my relatives in Shanghai.

05:59.920 --> 06:02.640
I took the college entrance examination
and went to university there.

06:02.720 --> 06:05.240
That's why Chen Maidong
doesn't remember me much.

06:07.680 --> 06:09.000
A college graduate.

06:09.080 --> 06:10.280
Postgraduate.

06:10.840 --> 06:13.000
I furthered my studies
after working for two years.

06:13.080 --> 06:14.560
Amazing.

06:14.640 --> 06:15.520
Grandma.

06:16.520 --> 06:18.240
Didn't you just say you were sleepy?

06:18.320 --> 06:20.360
Sleepy? Who is sleepy?

06:20.440 --> 06:21.600
Go to sleep if you are.

06:24.280 --> 06:27.120
That day, I kept telling you
about my grandson.

06:27.200 --> 06:28.360
I forgot to ask you.

06:28.440 --> 06:30.000
Are you still Shaking for a date?

06:30.080 --> 06:31.120
Did you get a match?

06:35.520 --> 06:38.080
Ma'am, I'm not in a hurry to Shake it.

06:38.160 --> 06:39.640
I want to focus on my career.

06:41.000 --> 06:43.000
Aren't you the same age as my grandson?

06:43.080 --> 06:44.200
How can you not be anxious?

06:44.280 --> 06:45.800
In my opinion,

06:45.880 --> 06:47.960
you were both delayed by your careers.

06:48.040 --> 06:49.960
Look at my grandson.

06:50.040 --> 06:51.840
A young man in his thirties.

06:51.920 --> 06:53.440
An established civil servant.

06:53.520 --> 06:55.440
Admired in town.

06:55.520 --> 06:56.720
That's why

06:56.800 --> 06:59.480
they had to invite him
and put him in the C position

06:59.960 --> 07:01.080
at tonight's dinner.

07:01.160 --> 07:02.880
The dinner wouldn't
have started without him.

07:02.960 --> 07:04.920
-Grandma.
-Ma'am, you are so hip.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.360
You even know about the C position.

07:06.840 --> 07:08.920
Don't interrupt, you two.
Listen to what I have to say.

07:10.720 --> 07:12.840
My grandson has a great body.

07:12.920 --> 07:14.440
He works out whenever he is free.

07:14.520 --> 07:16.560
Many years have gone by
without him catching a cold.

07:17.160 --> 07:19.000
Also, the year before last,

07:19.080 --> 07:21.560
he bought a house
with two bedrooms and a dining room

07:21.640 --> 07:23.640
in the eastern end of our town.

07:25.040 --> 07:26.480
It's a classy property

07:26.560 --> 07:28.880
and very well-decorated.

07:30.000 --> 07:31.000
Zhuang Jie.

07:32.440 --> 07:33.920
Your phone is ringing.

07:34.000 --> 07:35.160
Is it?

07:35.240 --> 07:36.720
I don't hear anything either.

07:40.560 --> 07:41.880
I put it on silent.

07:42.800 --> 07:44.480
Chen Maidong's eyes are sharp.

07:48.560 --> 07:49.640
Ma'am,

07:49.720 --> 07:50.840
I have to do some deliveries.

07:50.920 --> 07:52.880
I had so much fun chatting
that I had forgotten.

07:52.960 --> 07:54.960
Let's chat on WeChat later, okay?

07:55.040 --> 07:56.240
Don't leave so soon.

07:56.320 --> 07:58.200
Have you two added each other on WeChat?

08:02.760 --> 08:03.640
All right.

08:04.240 --> 08:05.640
Let's not delay your deliveries.

08:08.480 --> 08:09.520
Goodbye, ma'am.

08:11.400 --> 08:13.760
-Good!
-Great!

08:15.960 --> 08:18.280
What a lovely girl.

08:19.560 --> 08:21.240
She looks fair.

08:21.320 --> 08:22.800
She has bright eyes

08:22.880 --> 08:24.320
and a good figure.

08:24.800 --> 08:25.960
Most importantly,

08:26.040 --> 08:27.160
she is still single.

08:30.640 --> 08:31.800
Would you like peanuts?

08:34.919 --> 08:36.320
You only know how to eat.

08:44.120 --> 08:45.280
Sit down.

08:49.200 --> 08:51.800
Chen Maidong's grandma is quite funny.

08:51.880 --> 08:53.080
Forget about it.

08:53.160 --> 08:54.800
Even I felt awkward about what she said.

08:54.880 --> 08:55.960
That doesn't happen often.

08:56.040 --> 08:57.120
But his grandma

08:57.200 --> 08:58.880
wasn't exactly bragging either.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.440
An embalmer like Chen Maidong

09:00.520 --> 09:03.640
is indeed an important figure in our town.

09:03.720 --> 09:04.800
Before this,

09:04.880 --> 09:07.040
he used to work
in a large funeral parlor in Beijing.

09:07.120 --> 09:08.560
I heard that he is very experienced.

09:08.640 --> 09:10.440
Wang Xixia, why do you know everything?

09:10.520 --> 09:11.600
You don't say!

09:11.680 --> 09:12.800
Compared to you,

09:12.880 --> 09:15.400
I am considered a true native of Nanping.

09:15.960 --> 09:17.560
Still, he couldn't find a partner.

09:17.640 --> 09:18.840
His grandma is so worried

09:18.920 --> 09:21.320
that she wishes we could
consummate our marriage on the spot.

09:21.400 --> 09:23.520
It's difficult for Chen Maidong
to find a partner

09:23.600 --> 09:25.840
not just because of his profession.

09:25.920 --> 09:28.600
There are also rumors in town
that he was a bully when he was young

09:28.680 --> 09:30.320
and was involved in somebody's death.

09:31.360 --> 09:33.040
When he was young?

09:33.120 --> 09:34.320
When?

09:34.880 --> 09:36.400
Senior year of high school.

09:36.480 --> 09:37.880
The semester you transferred away.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.840
Didn't he always get
into fights back then?

09:39.920 --> 09:41.360
That time when somebody died,

09:41.440 --> 09:42.720
rumor has it that he was fighting

09:42.800 --> 09:44.240
with a group of gangsters.

09:45.520 --> 09:46.880
What is he like now?

09:46.960 --> 09:49.320
Does he still act like a gangster?

09:49.400 --> 09:51.280
He wasn't a gangster back then.

09:51.360 --> 09:52.680
At most, he was

09:52.760 --> 09:53.920
unruly.

09:54.600 --> 09:55.640
That's true.

09:56.240 --> 09:57.440
It was probably just rumors.

09:57.520 --> 09:58.680
If something had happened,

09:58.760 --> 10:01.760
how could he still work
without complications in the town?

10:01.840 --> 10:02.960
I think so too.

10:03.040 --> 10:04.720
But let me tell you.

10:04.800 --> 10:06.600
His grandma is also quite the character.

10:06.680 --> 10:09.120
She was the coach
of the provincial ping pong team

10:09.200 --> 10:10.520
and exceptionally respected.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.280
But after fighting with a colleague,

10:12.360 --> 10:14.680
her career was hindered
after receiving a penalty.

10:14.760 --> 10:16.840
I suspect
Chen Maidong's violent tendencies

10:16.920 --> 10:18.520
were inherited from his grandma.

10:19.800 --> 10:22.200
With these rumors about his family,

10:22.280 --> 10:24.240
it's not easy
for Chen Maidong to find a partner.

10:24.320 --> 10:27.080
How would any proper townspeople
dare to marry him?

10:43.560 --> 10:45.520
Do you really not remember Jie?

10:46.880 --> 10:49.760
Can you stop snacking in your bed?

10:49.840 --> 10:52.000
I'm asking you a question.
Don't interrupt me.

10:52.080 --> 10:54.200
How did she look like back in high school?

10:54.920 --> 10:56.400
Does she have a lot of suitors?

10:56.480 --> 10:57.920
What is she working as now?

10:58.000 --> 11:00.480
I haven't seen her
for more than ten years.

11:00.560 --> 11:02.080
Do you think I would know?

11:03.040 --> 11:05.760
Don't you have class reunions every year?

11:05.840 --> 11:07.720
Jie is so outstanding.

11:07.800 --> 11:10.120
Don't you boys talk about her?

11:10.200 --> 11:11.800
I don't anyway.

11:11.880 --> 11:13.480
Speak nicely.

11:13.560 --> 11:15.040
Look at you,

11:15.120 --> 11:17.720
lacking in judgment regarding women.

11:17.800 --> 11:19.520
You need me to look for you.

11:19.600 --> 11:20.800
At least,

11:20.880 --> 11:22.000
we know Jie's background.

11:22.080 --> 11:23.560
Her age matches you as well.

11:23.640 --> 11:25.680
She's not shy in character.

11:25.760 --> 11:27.360
She's much better than that wench--

11:27.440 --> 11:28.360
Grandma.

11:30.160 --> 11:31.640
You should speak nicely too.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.760
What? Can't I criticize her?

11:33.840 --> 11:35.560
That Song Yi is indeed a wench.

11:36.120 --> 11:37.800
She looks harmless.

11:37.880 --> 11:39.440
You were together for so many years.

11:39.520 --> 11:40.960
Yet she still cheated on you.

11:41.840 --> 11:43.080
You have a discerning eye.

11:43.880 --> 11:45.200
Didn't you notice

11:45.280 --> 11:46.880
that Zhuang Jie wears a prosthetic leg?

12:05.800 --> 12:08.000
I knew you would have this expression.

12:09.240 --> 12:10.320
When I was in high school,

12:10.400 --> 12:13.280
Zhuang Jie and her dad
got into a car accident.

12:13.360 --> 12:14.440
Her dad passed away.

12:15.320 --> 12:17.520
Zhuang Jie's right leg was amputated

12:18.240 --> 12:19.360
below the knee.

12:23.720 --> 12:26.200
Why didn't you prepare all your stuff?

12:26.280 --> 12:27.680
When the floor gets wet later,

12:27.760 --> 12:28.800
you'll have to hop out.

12:28.880 --> 12:30.560
If you fall, no one will care about you.

12:30.640 --> 12:31.960
Thank you, Mom.

12:33.760 --> 12:34.840
Is it hurting again?

12:36.120 --> 12:37.240
This is normal.

12:38.440 --> 12:39.440
I'll massage it for you.

12:39.520 --> 12:40.400
It's all right.

12:40.480 --> 12:41.400
I just need a bath.

12:41.480 --> 12:43.080
Just go to bed.

13:24.800 --> 13:25.760
Chen Maidong!

13:26.480 --> 13:27.920
I just processed what you said.

13:28.000 --> 13:29.120
What did you mean?

13:29.200 --> 13:30.360
What expression did I make?

13:30.440 --> 13:32.320
Calm down. Anger is bad for your health.

13:32.400 --> 13:33.920
Mark my words.

13:34.000 --> 13:36.240
I have taken a liking to Jie.

13:36.320 --> 13:38.280
I'm warning you.

13:38.360 --> 13:41.040
No one has the right to discriminate
against people with disabilities.

13:41.120 --> 13:43.280
I have never discriminated against her.

13:43.360 --> 13:44.720
I just don't like her that way.

13:45.400 --> 13:46.480
Why?

13:46.560 --> 13:48.680
She is too noisy. She talks more than you.

13:51.160 --> 13:52.280
You stinking brat!

13:52.360 --> 13:53.320
Chen Maidong!

13:53.400 --> 13:55.320
I'll teach you a lesson!

13:55.400 --> 13:57.840
If Zhuang Jie didn't have a disability,

13:57.920 --> 13:59.640
she would have been married much sooner.

13:59.720 --> 14:01.880
Moreover, she walks like the wind.

14:01.960 --> 14:04.080
No one would be able
to tell that her leg has a problem.

14:04.160 --> 14:07.080
If you continue to be this stubborn,
you'll be single all your life.

14:07.160 --> 14:08.400
Jie said it herself.

14:08.480 --> 14:11.400
There are people who found wives
just from WeChat's Shake.

14:11.480 --> 14:12.360
How about you?

14:12.440 --> 14:13.280
As I see it,

14:13.360 --> 14:15.200
you don't have the right to sleep.

14:15.280 --> 14:17.200
You should hold your phone all the time

14:17.280 --> 14:18.240
and keep shaking it!

14:19.520 --> 14:20.840
What kind of rotten idea is this?

14:20.920 --> 14:21.880
Shake?

14:21.960 --> 14:23.360
How old-fashioned.

14:36.760 --> 14:39.720
SINCERE INVITATION, LI TAO AND SONG YI

14:53.760 --> 14:56.440
LI TAO AND SONG YI

16:25.360 --> 16:28.360
Mom, what's for breakfast?

16:28.440 --> 16:30.640
All you know how to do is eat.

16:31.840 --> 16:33.680
Your sister's grades
have fallen to rock bottom.

16:33.760 --> 16:35.840
Can't you wake up earlier to tutor her?

16:35.920 --> 16:37.760
Don't you personally check her homework?

16:37.840 --> 16:39.200
Do you still need me?

16:39.280 --> 16:40.840
Do I look like I understand the paper?

16:41.560 --> 16:43.320
I can only intimidate her for a moment.

16:43.400 --> 16:45.960
Moreover, I can't watch her all day
and neglect my business.

16:46.040 --> 16:48.040
You've made many arrangements for me too.

16:48.120 --> 16:50.000
I've been on the move these days.

16:50.080 --> 16:51.080
Besides, I'm impatient.

16:51.160 --> 16:52.360
I can't be a tutor.

16:53.160 --> 16:55.360
Isn't Zhuang Yan's holiday starting
in a couple of days?

16:55.440 --> 16:57.160
Have him do it.
He is more reliable than me.

16:57.240 --> 16:58.520
Zhuang Yan?

16:58.600 --> 16:59.920
Reliable?

17:00.000 --> 17:01.120
Nonsense.

17:02.600 --> 17:04.960
Why do you badmouth your children
whenever they aren't here?

17:05.040 --> 17:06.839
He is our town's top scorer in the NCEE.

17:06.920 --> 17:08.800
Why can't he tutor an elementary schooler?

17:08.880 --> 17:10.760
Do you think
just having good grades is enough?

17:10.839 --> 17:13.000
You need a normal brain to be a tutor.

17:13.079 --> 17:14.400
Seriously, watch what you say.

17:17.839 --> 17:18.880
Zhuang Yan, you're back.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.280
Yan?

17:21.359 --> 17:22.319
Yan!

17:22.400 --> 17:23.680
No. Hold on a moment.

17:42.120 --> 17:43.800
This is Mr. He Zhangyue.

17:45.400 --> 17:47.040
This is my mom, Liao Tao.

17:48.160 --> 17:49.640
My elder sister, Zhuang Jie.

17:50.320 --> 17:52.080
And my younger sister, He Niaoniao.

17:55.120 --> 17:56.600
This is the new member of our family,

17:56.680 --> 17:57.600
Jisan Goose.

18:00.040 --> 18:01.360
Hello, Zhuang Yan.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.720
Hello, Jisan Goose.

18:02.800 --> 18:04.320
How cute.

18:05.720 --> 18:07.000
Look at him,

18:07.080 --> 18:09.320
dressing himself like a moth.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.760
Jisan Goose, my foot!

18:10.840 --> 18:11.720
I really…

18:12.280 --> 18:13.480
Take it easy.

18:13.560 --> 18:15.000
At least within the first 24 hours,

18:15.080 --> 18:16.640
refrain from using cuss words.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.840
Calm down.

18:27.960 --> 18:29.480
I…

18:29.560 --> 18:30.840
I'll check her homework.

18:44.960 --> 18:45.880
Master,

18:45.960 --> 18:47.760
today is a national holiday.

18:47.840 --> 18:50.200
Do public servants like us
have to take turns on duty too?

18:52.640 --> 18:53.920
Repeat the case report.

18:56.760 --> 19:00.000
An elderly woman whose head was crushed.

19:00.080 --> 19:03.280
Multiple open comminuted fractures.

19:04.640 --> 19:07.240
From the right side of the neck

19:07.320 --> 19:10.520
through the lips, nose, and left eye

19:10.600 --> 19:11.760
to the left forehead,

19:11.840 --> 19:14.080
there is an irregular laceration.

19:15.800 --> 19:17.280
The length…

19:20.040 --> 19:22.120
The length should be--

19:22.200 --> 19:24.400
The length
is approximately 15 cm to 18 cm.

19:24.480 --> 19:26.800
And there are
multiple facial bone puncture injuries.

19:26.880 --> 19:28.120
After cleaning,

19:28.200 --> 19:30.640
there are about 30 pieces
of bone fragments of various sizes

19:30.720 --> 19:31.560
from the head.

19:31.640 --> 19:33.400
Nearly one-third is concentrated
on the face.

19:33.480 --> 19:36.200
Because the face of the deceased
has little subcutaneous fat,

19:36.280 --> 19:37.840
the best solution to fix it is…

19:40.600 --> 19:41.760
The mortise and tenon technique.

19:44.640 --> 19:45.880
Reason?

19:47.720 --> 19:49.280
The reason being…

19:50.000 --> 19:51.120
She…

19:56.240 --> 19:57.440
The mortise and tenon technique

19:57.520 --> 19:59.040
is mainly used on the head and face

19:59.120 --> 20:00.160
to fix flat bones.

20:00.800 --> 20:02.600
Implant steel rods or wires

20:02.680 --> 20:04.840
in the spongy bone within the bone plate.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.080
Glue the plates together

20:06.160 --> 20:07.480
to connect the broken bones.

20:07.560 --> 20:09.680
This method can conceal the defect well.

20:09.760 --> 20:11.320
It will form a smooth bone surface.

20:11.400 --> 20:13.160
There will be no obvious dents
or protrusions.

20:13.240 --> 20:14.840
When is it not suitable?

20:15.800 --> 20:16.920
It's not suitable when…

20:18.000 --> 20:19.360
It's not suitable when…

20:19.440 --> 20:21.560
It's not suitable for inclined sections

20:21.640 --> 20:24.760
that are less than 70 degrees
or greater than 120 degrees.

20:28.960 --> 20:29.960
Bone recovery

20:30.040 --> 20:31.400
is crucial for plastic surgery.

20:31.480 --> 20:32.320
Yes.

20:32.400 --> 20:35.400
It's also the objective basis
for the recovery of other tissues.

20:35.480 --> 20:37.320
So I hope you can be more focused.

20:37.400 --> 20:38.760
Yes, Master.

20:38.840 --> 20:39.800
I will work harder.

20:41.840 --> 20:42.680
Xilun,

20:44.080 --> 20:46.040
I know you are not officially employed.

20:46.520 --> 20:48.400
You're prepping
for the accounting certification.

20:48.480 --> 20:50.520
But even if being an embalmer

20:50.600 --> 20:51.520
is just a temporary job

20:51.600 --> 20:52.920
before you become an accountant,

20:53.560 --> 20:55.960
I hope that you can
put more passion into it.

20:56.040 --> 20:58.240
Do we still need passion here?

20:58.320 --> 21:00.040
Compared to you,

21:00.120 --> 21:02.840
I think it is composure
that I lack the most.

21:05.960 --> 21:08.080
Zhang Xin? Why are you still here today?

21:08.160 --> 21:09.760
I'm finishing my last shift.

21:09.840 --> 21:11.600
Maidong, are you free tonight?

21:11.680 --> 21:13.560
I want to treat everyone to a meal.

21:13.640 --> 21:14.640
Join us.

21:15.520 --> 21:16.400
Sure.

21:16.480 --> 21:18.120
The one resigning gets all the respect.

21:18.200 --> 21:20.560
How many times have I invited Master?
He never ate with me.

21:41.880 --> 21:44.120
NANPING TOWN ELDERLY SERVICE CENTER

21:44.200 --> 21:46.080
Mrs. Chen.

21:46.160 --> 21:48.880
You were talking about drinking some tea.
Why are you leaving now?

21:50.400 --> 21:52.320
Mrs. Chen!

22:19.000 --> 22:22.640
XIAXI VILLAGE

22:23.520 --> 22:26.240
LIN BAOBAO VETERINARY CLINIC

22:43.600 --> 22:44.720
Lin.

22:54.120 --> 22:55.720
Lin!

23:19.520 --> 23:20.760
Lin!

23:24.560 --> 23:25.840
I'm here!

23:30.920 --> 23:31.960
There you are.

23:32.800 --> 23:35.040
You're just in time
to try what I just learned to make.

23:35.120 --> 23:36.440
Coffee jelly.

23:37.520 --> 23:38.760
What were you doing?

23:38.840 --> 23:41.400
I shouted so hard for you
that my throat was fried.

23:41.480 --> 23:44.080
I was in the backyard
giving an infusion to the sheep.

23:44.640 --> 23:46.640
It's from the breeding farm.

23:46.720 --> 23:49.480
She hasn't been able
to eat much after giving birth.

23:49.560 --> 23:50.640
I told you already.

23:50.720 --> 23:52.040
Stop being a vet.

23:52.120 --> 23:53.160
How old are you?

23:53.240 --> 23:54.360
It's so exhausting.

23:55.480 --> 23:56.840
It's nothing.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.680
Come, sit here.

23:59.760 --> 24:00.720
Sit.

24:03.360 --> 24:04.960
Let me tell you something serious.

24:06.160 --> 24:09.600
Did you find out
that my grapefruit jam is ready,

24:09.680 --> 24:11.640
so you came here specifically
to pick it up?

24:11.720 --> 24:15.120
Sometimes, I have to deal with matters
more important than food, don't I?

24:17.800 --> 24:18.680
Here.

24:20.360 --> 24:22.920
Look at the profile of this child.

24:23.000 --> 24:24.840
Will this one get along with Maidong?

24:24.920 --> 24:27.600
Do you regard me as a love expert too?

24:27.680 --> 24:28.600
Come on.

24:28.680 --> 24:31.080
You don't have to hide it in front of me.

24:31.160 --> 24:32.640
Don't I know you well enough?

24:32.720 --> 24:33.800
I'm telling you.

24:33.880 --> 24:34.760
This?

24:35.600 --> 24:37.800
I took great pains
to borrow this from Wu Xuehua.

24:38.280 --> 24:39.360
Have a look.

24:41.200 --> 24:42.320
Don't criticize me.

24:42.400 --> 24:44.600
For my grandson's marriage,

24:44.680 --> 24:46.640
I will do anything.

24:49.040 --> 24:49.880
Glasses.

24:55.720 --> 24:58.760
ZHUANG YAN, MALE, FILE NUMBER

25:17.480 --> 25:18.640
Here comes the soup.

25:19.240 --> 25:20.160
Here.

25:26.840 --> 25:28.520
Believe it or not, I'll take it

25:28.600 --> 25:30.320
and marinate it with my chickens later.

25:32.480 --> 25:33.560
Why are you staring at me?

25:33.640 --> 25:35.520
Do you know
I've tolerated you for a long time?

25:35.600 --> 25:37.480
Take off this black outfit after dinner.

25:37.560 --> 25:38.920
It irritates me.

25:39.000 --> 25:40.160
Jisan Goose,

25:40.240 --> 25:41.800
after being given a name by me,

25:42.280 --> 25:43.880
is no longer ordinary poultry.

25:43.960 --> 25:45.240
It's family.

25:45.320 --> 25:46.760
I gave you a name too.

25:46.840 --> 25:48.040
Why are you worse than poultry?

25:48.120 --> 25:49.920
I relied on poultry
to put you through school.

25:50.000 --> 25:51.360
What can I rely on you kids for?

25:51.440 --> 25:53.520
Our mom's patience is wearing thinner.

25:54.320 --> 25:56.720
She's already howling
less than three hours after he came home.

25:56.800 --> 25:58.200
Busybody.

25:59.760 --> 26:01.280
How many bowls have you eaten?

26:01.360 --> 26:03.440
Put it down and go study.

26:03.520 --> 26:05.160
You'll get sleepy while doing homework.

26:06.440 --> 26:08.960
Niaoniao is growing.

26:10.080 --> 26:11.480
Zhuang Yan is building muscle.

26:11.560 --> 26:12.600
As usual, I'm on a diet.

26:12.680 --> 26:14.280
Everyone has their own way of eating.

26:14.360 --> 26:15.200
Don't be mad.

26:15.280 --> 26:16.840
Beauty is in the bones, not in the skin.

26:16.920 --> 26:18.080
You will all look like me.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.640
Genes have already determined it.

26:19.720 --> 26:21.320
What's the point of dieting or bulking?

26:21.400 --> 26:23.080
That's all nonsense.

26:23.160 --> 26:25.760
If you have the time,
you might as well cultivate your mind.

26:25.840 --> 26:27.480
None of you are serious about your life.

26:27.560 --> 26:28.800
It's unpleasant to look at.

26:29.560 --> 26:31.760
Mom, if you don't like me,

26:31.840 --> 26:34.240
you don't have to try to be subtle
and include everyone.

26:34.320 --> 26:36.280
Learning to draw has always been my dream.

26:36.360 --> 26:37.320
How am I not serious?

26:37.400 --> 26:40.640
Stop talking about your dreams with me.

26:40.720 --> 26:42.000
You're making a joke of yourself.

26:42.080 --> 26:44.640
Since you were a child,
you had a new dream every year.

26:44.720 --> 26:45.880
Did you realize any of them?

26:45.960 --> 26:47.840
You are the most unstable person
in the family.

26:47.920 --> 26:49.960
After going to university for a few days,

26:50.040 --> 26:51.960
you've learned nothing but a new accent.

26:52.040 --> 26:55.320
Stop talking about your highbrow art
using that pretentious tone of yours.

26:55.400 --> 26:56.520
Sure.

26:57.080 --> 26:59.440
If that's the case,
then I'll tell you directly.

27:00.000 --> 27:01.520
I don't like this university anyway.

27:01.600 --> 27:02.920
Can you let me drop out of school?

27:03.000 --> 27:04.440
I want to specialize in painting.

27:04.520 --> 27:05.400
What did you say?

27:07.000 --> 27:09.040
I dare you to say it again.

27:09.120 --> 27:10.840
Let's eat first.
The shop is waiting for you.

27:10.920 --> 27:11.960
Come, sit down.

27:13.600 --> 27:14.520
Mom,

27:15.280 --> 27:16.360
I told you before.

27:16.440 --> 27:17.960
I took the entrance exam for you.

27:18.560 --> 27:20.080
My mission is now complete.

27:20.160 --> 27:22.400
I came back this time to talk to you.

27:23.600 --> 27:25.760
Please respect my uniqueness.

27:25.840 --> 27:27.600
This person you found

27:27.680 --> 27:30.160
shouldn't be suitable for Maidong, right?

27:30.240 --> 27:32.360
Did you even look carefully
before telling me no?

27:32.440 --> 27:34.200
There are matters

27:34.280 --> 27:35.520
where everyone

27:35.600 --> 27:37.080
would have an agreed opinion.

27:37.160 --> 27:38.920
Don't discriminate against this child.

27:39.000 --> 27:41.360
I know you are well-informed.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.640
You may know the inside story,

27:42.720 --> 27:44.520
but I've met this kid personally.

27:44.600 --> 27:46.200
She's pretty and has a good character.

27:46.280 --> 27:47.680
The rest aren't an issue.

27:48.560 --> 27:51.400
Your mentality really impresses me.

27:52.280 --> 27:53.120
Actually,

27:54.560 --> 27:55.800
I was a little hesitant.

27:55.880 --> 27:57.040
At the beginning,

27:57.120 --> 27:58.240
I didn't want to accept it.

27:58.320 --> 27:59.520
After thinking about it,

27:59.600 --> 28:00.600
I say screw it.

28:00.680 --> 28:01.680
What times are we in now?

28:01.760 --> 28:03.720
I can't block the fate
of these two children

28:03.800 --> 28:05.960
just because of some small disability.

28:07.480 --> 28:09.800
Can you give me back my freedom?

28:10.360 --> 28:13.200
My hands are made for painting.

28:13.280 --> 28:15.720
It's not for computers
or marinating chickens for our shop.

28:15.800 --> 28:18.640
Only pure art can soothe my mind.

28:18.720 --> 28:20.640
On this point, Jisan Goose understands me

28:20.720 --> 28:22.240
better than you do.

28:23.320 --> 28:24.960
-Zhuang Yan.
-His mind?

28:25.720 --> 28:27.520
I think you have a mental illness!

28:27.600 --> 28:28.640
Eat up.

28:28.720 --> 28:30.640
I'll marinate this one
that knows you so well!

28:30.720 --> 28:32.480
I'll show you that I am still your mom!

28:34.520 --> 28:35.720
Yan!

28:35.800 --> 28:37.960
Come and save the goose, Yan!

28:39.080 --> 28:40.560
What was that for?

28:42.360 --> 28:43.720
The same as usual.

28:43.800 --> 28:46.400
Look at the card and tell the story.
Tell me something nice.

28:46.480 --> 28:49.240
In the first card, the sun is shining.

28:49.320 --> 28:51.680
A little happy and sweet.

28:51.760 --> 28:53.040
It's done.

28:53.120 --> 28:54.200
Calm down.

28:54.280 --> 28:56.800
Love is not a bed of roses.

28:56.880 --> 28:58.640
The most important thing to Maidong

28:58.720 --> 29:00.040
is determination.

29:00.120 --> 29:01.320
There is hope

29:01.400 --> 29:03.600
of establishing an intimate relationship,

29:03.680 --> 29:05.600
but the decision-making process

29:05.680 --> 29:09.200
is very difficult and painful.

29:10.080 --> 29:11.440
That's normal.

29:11.520 --> 29:13.640
Maidong is no longer a child.
He can bear it.

29:13.720 --> 29:15.360
Let's look at the second card.

29:16.120 --> 29:18.200
This person is holding a lamp.

29:18.280 --> 29:20.040
There is also a cane by the side.

29:20.120 --> 29:22.320
Accurate, so accurate.

29:22.400 --> 29:25.760
This shows
that the Zhuang family's child is lonely

29:25.840 --> 29:27.600
and is groping forward

29:27.680 --> 29:29.320
in the darkness.

29:29.400 --> 29:31.000
This child's thoughts are heavy.

29:31.080 --> 29:35.480
This child is trying to steady their mind
with learning and thinking,

29:35.560 --> 29:37.600
but it won't work.

29:37.680 --> 29:38.960
Anyway, I think

29:39.040 --> 29:40.280
this child

29:40.360 --> 29:42.400
is not a particularly happy person.

29:43.200 --> 29:44.040
Really?

29:44.720 --> 29:45.960
I didn't get that impression.

29:46.040 --> 29:47.520
In the third card,

29:47.600 --> 29:49.320
this woman is very strange.

29:49.400 --> 29:51.080
Her aura is also very domineering.

29:51.160 --> 29:52.480
Between these two,

29:52.560 --> 29:54.160
she might be…

29:54.240 --> 29:55.560
A mistress?

29:57.920 --> 29:59.520
Don't interrupt me.

29:59.600 --> 30:01.680
This image isn't that terrible.

30:01.760 --> 30:02.720
I'm just saying

30:02.800 --> 30:05.520
that she will cause a certain impact

30:05.600 --> 30:07.000
between the two children.

30:07.080 --> 30:09.080
All right, this woman
is not important. Ignore her.

30:09.160 --> 30:10.600
Just tell me.

30:10.680 --> 30:13.920
Is Maidong fated
to be with the Zhuang family's child?

30:14.000 --> 30:15.600
Well…

30:16.280 --> 30:17.640
What should I say?

30:17.720 --> 30:19.600
Just say it bluntly.

30:19.680 --> 30:22.440
If you ask me if they are fated,

30:22.520 --> 30:23.920
I don't think they are merely fated.

30:24.000 --> 30:24.960
Maybe there is

30:25.600 --> 30:27.960
a deeper bond between them.

30:33.280 --> 30:34.360
Maidong.

30:34.440 --> 30:35.400
Hai.

30:35.480 --> 30:36.360
Xilun.

30:37.640 --> 30:38.640
From now on,

30:38.720 --> 30:41.320
I guess there won't be any chance
to work with you guys again.

30:42.720 --> 30:44.680
This will be our parting dinner.

30:45.160 --> 30:48.400
But knowing you guys has been an honor.

30:48.480 --> 30:49.760
Cheers.

30:55.080 --> 30:56.400
Sadly, even today,

30:56.480 --> 30:58.080
I can't have a good drink with you.

30:59.880 --> 31:01.760
It's okay, we understand.

31:01.840 --> 31:03.960
During these four years working
in our unit,

31:04.040 --> 31:05.800
I never touched a single drop of wine.

31:06.400 --> 31:08.240
So if I drink too much today,

31:08.320 --> 31:09.640
please forgive me.

31:10.640 --> 31:12.040
Xilun.

31:12.120 --> 31:15.600
Soon, won't it be your turn
to host a parting dinner?

31:16.920 --> 31:18.080
What are you saying?

31:18.720 --> 31:20.560
I have recently been working hard

31:20.640 --> 31:22.040
to hone my skills.

31:22.120 --> 31:24.080
I never thought about resigning.

31:24.160 --> 31:25.720
I'm not rushing to get married like you.

31:25.800 --> 31:26.640
Come on.

31:26.720 --> 31:28.120
In this profession,

31:28.200 --> 31:30.400
you can tell who hates their job
with one glance.

31:30.480 --> 31:33.000
You don't have the same aura as us.

31:33.080 --> 31:34.800
Wait, you're the deserter.

31:34.880 --> 31:36.280
You're one to talk!

31:36.360 --> 31:37.880
Hai, you be the judge.

31:38.520 --> 31:39.880
How do I not have the same aura?

31:40.480 --> 31:41.760
What kind of aura is it?

31:41.840 --> 31:43.920
Indeed, you don't
have the character of an undertaker.

31:44.440 --> 31:45.440
You're right.

31:47.160 --> 31:49.080
You are bullying the newcomer.

31:49.160 --> 31:50.760
In the morning,

31:50.840 --> 31:53.160
Master also said that I have no passion.

31:53.240 --> 31:54.520
But I don't understand.

31:54.600 --> 31:56.000
What are you basing this on?

31:56.520 --> 31:57.920
Then let me tell you about Hai.

31:58.960 --> 32:01.840
Hai has driven for the funeral house
for more than 20 years.

32:01.920 --> 32:05.400
He is responsible
for moving bodies and changing clothes.

32:05.480 --> 32:08.320
In China, male remains
weigh 75 kg on average.

32:08.400 --> 32:10.480
Females, 65 kg.

32:10.560 --> 32:12.560
To complete a set of proper procedures,

32:12.640 --> 32:14.720
a body has to be moved
at least five times,

32:14.800 --> 32:16.760
not including other added services.

32:16.840 --> 32:18.080
Just looking at the statistics,

32:18.160 --> 32:20.960
Hai's physical output is no less
than that of a professional athlete.

32:21.040 --> 32:23.240
So do you think Hai has a passion

32:23.320 --> 32:24.240
for this profession?

32:25.760 --> 32:26.600
Here.

32:26.680 --> 32:27.960
I'll toast you.

32:28.520 --> 32:29.440
Cheers, Hai.

32:39.280 --> 32:40.200
Zhuang Yan.

32:45.400 --> 32:47.120
I went around the town twice
looking for you.

32:48.760 --> 32:50.640
Dinner is ready. Go home and eat.

32:50.720 --> 32:52.520
No, I want to listen for a while longer.

32:52.600 --> 32:54.240
No, I mean, I want to eat some more.

33:02.360 --> 33:03.600
Master, do you know them?

33:03.680 --> 33:04.840
Let's share a table.

33:04.920 --> 33:06.000
The more the merrier.

33:06.080 --> 33:07.080
I don't know her well.

33:07.760 --> 33:08.800
Whatever.

33:08.880 --> 33:10.600
Your alcohol tolerance has increased.

33:10.680 --> 33:11.880
You drank a lot.

33:12.520 --> 33:14.080
Is Jisan drinking with you?

33:14.160 --> 33:15.760
Speaking of passion,

33:15.840 --> 33:17.280
Chen Maidong is the best.

33:17.360 --> 33:19.120
Everyone is the same.
Stop talking about me.

33:19.200 --> 33:20.320
Did you know

33:20.400 --> 33:23.680
many people found their motivation
to do this job from watching you?

33:24.200 --> 33:25.240
Feng Xilun,

33:25.320 --> 33:28.320
you don't know
what a good teacher you have.

33:28.880 --> 33:32.520
Last year, Maidong handled special remains
at least five times.

33:32.600 --> 33:34.800
-Thank you.
-Every session lasted more than 15 hours.

33:34.880 --> 33:38.480
He also traveled to other places
to help handle tougher cases.

33:38.560 --> 33:41.040
Our province's whole system
of bone reconstruction techniques

33:41.120 --> 33:42.160
was established by Maidong.

33:42.720 --> 33:43.640
Without him,

33:43.720 --> 33:44.800
those who died in accidents

33:44.880 --> 33:47.400
wouldn't be able to leave this world
in a dignified manner.

33:47.480 --> 33:50.360
If he did not have passion or love,

33:50.440 --> 33:51.880
why is he doing this?

33:56.440 --> 33:57.920
Drink less.

33:58.000 --> 33:59.240
Drink less.

33:59.320 --> 34:01.400
I really don't understand.

34:01.480 --> 34:03.360
Why does a woman after 25

34:03.440 --> 34:05.360
have to hurriedly fall in love

34:05.440 --> 34:06.800
and get married?

34:06.880 --> 34:09.120
And why does she have
to give up a job she likes

34:09.199 --> 34:11.440
for her marriage?

34:12.360 --> 34:14.679
No one may believe me if I say it.

34:14.760 --> 34:18.360
I really have formed an attachment
to the funeral profession.

34:18.440 --> 34:21.600
Every corpse I took care of
was like my friend.

34:21.679 --> 34:24.000
I could even imagine

34:24.080 --> 34:25.719
their lives.

34:25.800 --> 34:27.199
I could clearly see

34:27.280 --> 34:29.840
how they spent their last days.

34:31.159 --> 34:33.600
-Here.
-Don't be so sad, Zhang Xin.

34:40.520 --> 34:41.520
Let's go home.

34:43.159 --> 34:45.679
Keep these experiences in mind.

34:45.760 --> 34:48.440
Don't expect everyone else
to understand it.

34:49.920 --> 34:51.159
Physical decay

34:51.239 --> 34:53.239
is only another truth of death.

34:53.320 --> 34:54.560
Through sight and smell,

34:54.639 --> 34:56.480
it reminds us of how fragile our flesh is.

34:56.560 --> 34:57.880
There are Buddhist monks

34:57.960 --> 34:59.240
who observe corpses

34:59.320 --> 35:00.440
to stay alert to life.

35:00.520 --> 35:02.640
How do they observe it?

35:03.920 --> 35:05.320
In each stage of decomposition,

35:05.400 --> 35:06.920
the body will appear differently.

35:07.000 --> 35:07.880
Distension.

35:07.960 --> 35:09.120
Rupture.

35:09.200 --> 35:10.080
Exudation of blood.

35:10.160 --> 35:11.320
Putrefaction.

35:11.400 --> 35:12.240
Discoloration.

35:22.280 --> 35:23.720
The monks use this method

35:23.800 --> 35:26.000
to achieve permanent suppression
of their own desires.

35:32.600 --> 35:34.240
I have to work the night shift.

35:34.320 --> 35:35.400
I'm leaving.

35:39.640 --> 35:40.560
Enjoy your meal.

40:21.840 --> 40:28.400
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
